&lt;li&gt;Dynamic Planning — Combatant Command decision-making, Joint Planning Process, homeland defense, and battle-staff operations&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Non-Kinetic Effects Integration — Electromagnetic warfare, cyber, space, EMSO, and integration of non-kinetic effects into joint targeting&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Modeling &amp;amp; Simulation — Constructive simulation, force-on-force analysis, synthetic data, and AI behavior representation&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Sensor Orchestration — Sensor tasking, collection management, multi-INT strategies, and sensor-to-shooter workflows&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Dynamic Agentic IAMD Planning — Integrated Air and Missile Defense, weapon-target pairing, threat profiles, ROE, and agentic defensive planning&lt;/li&gt;
